{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>《香港小姐2026競選決賽》今晚（8月31日）舉行，賽前當然有大家個關注的紅地氈環節，雖然陸陸續續都有不少前港姐登場，不過等到苟芸慧作為嘉賓現身，全場其他前港姐瞬間失色。苟芸慧穿起低胸深藍色晚裝，除了適度展露自己的好身材之餘，更不失高貴的味道。</p><figure><img alt=\"苟芸慧穿起低胸深藍色晚裝。（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260830/1170804895427989504237694.jpeg/-tSmE6zdC2na5DvFsHKPeOkaZ4VMwUhKs8VxYoXFcWI\"/><figcaption>苟芸慧穿起低胸深藍色晚裝。（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"苟芸慧好靚呀。（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260830/1170804892596703232601294.jpeg/8slrtiWbHZd1fImnWphxXBI_Tw-x798yGDz2CC489gg\"/><figcaption>苟芸慧好靚呀。（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"苟芸慧好高貴。（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260830/1170804889991909376259603.jpeg/TZc3Of8NZ5C914hx1tbdyKpdBxDzFoXAbERgOVpEYDk\"/><figcaption>苟芸慧好高貴。（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"苟芸慧贏晒同場女藝人。（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260830/1170804887307423744902541.jpeg/miHTsCG2cp2V8x-pGq85MIW9QrVyECVVGjeXaCw3l2g\"/><figcaption>苟芸慧贏晒同場女藝人。（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-30T10:58:33.053842+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":188,"images":4,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}